{
  "summary": "This experiment tested scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5203 (F1: 0.4982), outperforming the singleprofile baseline (config_001) but underperforming multiprofile setups with scvi_n200 (configs 003, 004). The results suggest scvi_n200 may provide benefits in singleprofile, but the exact impact of profile settings versus encoder choice remains uncertain. The role of aggregation or image modalities is not evaluated in this configuration."
}

